{"id":"3beb02cabab5d879","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-lem-condensation.md","title":"Condensation Lemma for L","display":"lem-condensation — Condensation Lemma for L","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-condensation","aliases":["58-lem-condensation"],"display":"lem-condensation — Condensation Lemma for L","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-condensation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-condensation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-condensation — Condensation Lemma for L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq L_\\alpha\">\\(X\\subseteq L_\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)\">\\((X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> denotes the Mostowski collapse of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\in)\">\\((X,\\in)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\pi:(X,\\in)\\cong(L_\\beta,\\in)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\pi:(X,\\in)\\cong(L_\\beta,\\in)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the condensation lemma for the constructible hierarchy. The transitive collapse is not merely an arbitrary transitive set; it is an initial level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\beta\">\\(L_\\beta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The general statement that a well-founded extensional relation has a transitive collapse is the Mostowski collapse theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land(X,\\in)\\preccurlyeq(L_\\alpha,\\in)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\pi:(X,\\in)\\cong(L_\\beta,\\in)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L_\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1090,"backlinks":[{"id":"2331ede3868d950e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"This is the transitive special case of [[../batch10/58-lem-condensation.md]]; a nontransitive elementary substructure first collapses to such an $L_\\alpha$."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3884","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-lem-condensation.md|58-lem-condensation]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["e91c1261e1c2374b","c14ba496c480dcd6","8c8abfb908cc9a24","5582a281f15a33c2"]}